3353               / MUY EMULATION FAMILY (MODE A)
3354               /  MUYEM  - MUY (PLAIN)   : MULTIPLICAND IS SAVMQ (MQ EMULATED)
3355               /      IF AC NON-ZERO ON ENTRY, ADD IT TO PRODUCT
3356               /  MUYMQL - MQL + MUY     : MULTIPLICAND IS AC (MQL STORES AC IN SAVMQ)
3357               /  MULTIPLICAND IS IN NEXT WORD AFTER CALL
3358               /  MUYCORE - COMMON KERNEL : 12-ITER SHIFT/ADD to 24-BIT PRODUCT
3359               /  RESULTS: AC = HIGH 12 BITS, SAVMQ = LOW 12 BITS
3360               /  TEMPS: MDCNT, EMOP, EMAC, DBLHI, AND MQSAV IF EMTEST DEFINED.
3361               /  ALGORITHM:  REUSE SAVMQ AS BOTH MULTIPLIER AND LO RESULT
3362               /     INITIALIZATION: LINK IS CLEAR; MULTIPLIER IN MQ;
3363               /         MDCNT -14; MULTIPLICAND IN EMOP; HI PROD IN DBLHI
3364               /      IF LSB OF PRODUCT IS 1 ADD EMOP TO SAVMQ
3365               /  CONSTANTS: THIR -14 OCTAL FOR 12 WAY SHIFT
